      {
        "name": "search_supported_carriers",
        "title": "Search supported carriers",
        "description": "Use this when the user asks which couriers Parcels supports, names a courier that must be converted to an exact carrier slug, wants to choose a carrier, or a tracking error asks for carrier selection. Search by carrier name or slug; omit query to list common supported carriers. Return the exact slug to pass to track_shipment as carrier_slug. This tool does not track a shipment.",
