        "name": "get_tracking_result",
        "title": "Get a tracking result",
        "description": "Use this only as the required continuation after track_shipment returns state pending. Wait for retryAfterSeconds, pass the returned requestToken unchanged as request_token, and keep calling this tool while the result remains pending until it returns complete, requires_input, or error. If requires_input is returned, stop polling, ask the user for requiredFields, and start a new track_shipment call with additional_fields. Do not use it to start a new tracking request.",
